d\n\nGameplay Modifications:\nNo proximity prompt duration\nMonster notifications\nAutomatic monster avoidance\nNo Eyefestation\nNo Searchlights (toggleable after first encounter)\nNo Steams\n\nLobby Features:\nJoin a random game button\n\nMiscellaneous Scripts:\nQuick access to Nameless Admin, Infinite Yield, and Dex\n\nESP Features:\nKey ESP\nMonster ESP\nTricksterRoom ESP\nMonster Locker ESP\n\nAutomatic Functions:\nAuto-apply ESP to new keys and monsters\nAuto-destroy certain game elements (Eyefestation, Searchlights, Steams)\n\nSafety Features:\nAutomatic teleportation to safe location when monsters spawn (if enabled)\n\nOrganized UI:\nMultiple tabs for easy navigation (Main, Lobby, Credits, Misc Scripts)\n\nNotification System:\nAlerts for monster spawns","tags":["Pressure","pressure roblox","pressure Roblox script","roblox pressure","roblox pressure script"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"65e2f9fcc8e5fa7882c28967","username":"crumies","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"65e2f9fcc8e5fa7882c28967","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T18:08:00.692Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e6b360710ec3c51ad4","editBy":{"_id":"65e2f9fcc8e5fa7882c28967","username":"crumies","status":"offline","id":"65e2f9fcc8e5fa7882c28967"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-03-27T21:53:42.117Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"66b63992a6b52236b30da649","commentBy":{"_id":"668ba12a3890752919e9a0c9","username":"nokey","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a89f1ec38fa32cfde2a76bc6412865b570a24475ad6f9d411cf95